{"5070040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Cosmonaut", "steam_appid": 5070040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped aboard Sverdrup Station, deep within the permanently shadowed regions of the lunar south pole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070040/extras/0533008fca0e1cf8724935531467371a.poster.avif?t=1787924239\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070040/extras/0533008fca0e1cf8724935531467371a.webm?t=1787924239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070040/extras/0533008fca0e1cf8724935531467371a.mp4?t=1787924239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objectives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Restore power and unlock new areas by repairing the station's terminals.<br>- Search the abandoned station for parts to repair your EVA suit.<br>- Salvage components to build a makeshift lunar escape vehicle.<br>- Mine lunar ice to produce the fuel needed for your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember... you're not alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Something lurks in the darkness, and it's drawn to your presence.<br>- Your only defense is the TP-85 shotgun. Scavenge ammunition throughout the station to survive.<br>- Uncover the fate of Sverdrup Station's crew by scanning QR codes and listening to tape recordings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in a single sitting, though multiple playthroughs may be needed to uncover everything. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped aboard Sverdrup Station, deep within the permanently shadowed regions of the lunar south pole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070040/extras/0533008fca0e1cf8724935531467371a.poster.avif?t=1787924239\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070040/extras/0533008fca0e1cf8724935531467371a.webm?t=1787924239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070040/extras/0533008fca0e1cf8724935531467371a.mp4?t=1787924239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objectives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Restore power and unlock new areas by repairing the station's terminals.<br>- Search the abandoned station for parts to repair your EVA suit.<br>- Salvage components to build a makeshift lunar escape vehicle.<br>- Mine lunar ice to produce the fuel needed for your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember... you're not alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Something lurks in the darkness, and it's drawn to your presence.<br>- Your only defense is the TP-85 shotgun. Scavenge ammunition throughout the station to survive.<br>- Uncover the fate of Sverdrup Station's crew by scanning QR codes and listening to tape recordings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in a single sitting, though multiple playthroughs may be needed to uncover everything. </p>", "short_description": "The Last Cosmonaut is a first person survival horror puzzle game set in an abandoned lunar outpost. Collect parts, repair the escape vehicle, and keep the lights on, as something lurks in the shadows...", "supported_languages": "English<s